      "date": "2026-01-23T11:12:00.000Z",
      "title": "Hindustan Oil Exploration Company Limited Announces Resignation of Ramasamy Jeevanandam as Managing Director",
      "body": "Hindustan Oil Exploration Company Limited announced the resignation of Mr. Ramasamy Jeevanandam (DIN: 07046442) as the Managing Director of the Company due to health and personal issues. He will continue to serve in his current position of Managing Director till the appointment of a new Managing Director for the Company. The effective date of his resignation shall be as agreed between him and the Board of Directors, and the same will be notified separately. Over the past 11 years, Mr. Ramasamy Jeevanandam has served as HOEC's Executive Director & Chief Financial Officer for more than 8.5 years and has also led HOEC as the Managing Director for the last 2 years. During his tenure he has made significant contributions to the growth of the Company's portfolio.",
